{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phantom Necro</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule the dead. Summon the souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Phantom Necro</i> is a strategic RPG set in a world where powerful factions collide.<br>Lead your own army as a necromancer and rise to claim the ultimate throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather souls to summon legendary phantoms and form squads that shake the battlefield.<br>Your choices and strategies will reshape the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summoning System</strong><br>Collect souls and summon a variety of phantoms to build your own unique army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/summon.gif?t=1749126863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad System</strong><br>Strategy begins with formation. Assign phantoms to squads and seize control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/squad.gif?t=1749126863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat</strong><br>You\u2019re part of the fight! Engage in real-time combat where both player and phantoms join forces on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/battle.gif?t=1749126863\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heroes</strong><br>Mighty heroes will appear\u2014beings of overwhelming power.<br>Sometimes their target is you, other times your enemies.<br>Use every tactic\u2014from ambushes to head-on clashes\u2014to bring them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718410/extras/hero.gif?t=1749126863\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamsta